# Dev / test / deploy

A feature is done when it has implementation + tests + observability + failure behavior + docs + repeatable validation.

Priority: correctness → observability → testability → maintainability → measured performance → sophistication.

- Contracts first. Golden AMP fixtures. Synthetic node uses the same encoder.
- Host unit tests without hardware. Simulation seedable.
- Separate versions: firmware, protocol, DB schema, config, features, model.
- Demo / field / calibration / experiment: never present simulated data as real.
- Compose for dev; systemd OK on the Pi (ADR-016).
- MVN still gates field readiness. Do not claim accuracy, range, or energy savings without evidence.
- Next implementation slice: PMS-first E2E on the ESP-IDF tree — not an AI model first.
- Next ADR number: 018.

This rule does not override GOV-EXEC-001.
